    "title": "Free Electronics Recycling Event at Ponderosa Landfill for Blue Earth County Residents - NewsBreak",
    "text": "hoodline.com\nwebsite\nMankato\nFree Electronics Recycling Event at Ponderosa Landfill for Blue Earth County Residents\nBy Ariel Kozlov,\n5 hours agoThe city of Mankato has announced an initiative inviting Blue Earth County residents to responsibly dispose of their old gadgets. Scheduled for June 17th, the Electronics Collection Event at Ponderosa Landfill offers an opportunity for locals to declutter and recycle their outdated or broken electronics. Participation in the event is simple and, more importantly, free, provided that attendees can furnish proof of residency within the county.",
